      "main_manual_observations": [
        "Reviewed callback aliases, function-table fields, constructors/builders/Debug/PartialEq and all forwarding methods. Dense slots are current schema order, not stable field IDs. Optional slot callback absence is capability absence and does not silently fall back.",
        "Stage returns a capability result, not a mutation acknowledgement. Stage clone accounting precedes resource copying in the caller; this wrapper does not enforce global budget or rollback. Query/removal errors belong to the concrete World callback."
      ],
